          <h3 id="videos">Videos to Watch</h3>

          <p>
            Watch both of these &mdash; together they cover the visual side of what we&rsquo;ve
            just read about. The first is a NZ-curriculum overview; the second is a tight
            animation of how a zeitgeber resets a clock.
          </p>

